{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/1501","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/1501/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/1501/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/1501/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit/issues/1501","id":264837644,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUyNjQ4Mzc2NDQ=","number":1501,"title":"Code Coverage broken for .NETCore with xunit 2.3.0","user":{"login":"smadala","id":4337332,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMzczMzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4337332?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala","html_url":"https://github.com/smadala","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smadala/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":75574707,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3NTU3NDcwNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"FEF2C0","default":false,"description":"A fault in an existing feature"},{"id":241290899,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDEyOTA4OTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Core%20framework","name":"Core framework","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"xunit.v3.core"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":7,"created_at":"2017-10-12T07:18:51Z","updated_at":"2018-08-23T18:33:15Z","closed_at":"2017-10-12T14:58:41Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"`Analyze Code Coverage for Selected Tests` in VS 15.5.0 Preview 2.0 broken for xUnit 2.3.0.\r\n## Steps to reproduce\r\nCreate .NETCore xUnit project with following template.\r\n```xml\r\n<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\r\n\r\n  <PropertyGroup>\r\n    <TargetFramework>netcoreapp2.0</TargetFramework>\r\n    <DebugType>Full</DebugType>\r\n    <IsPackable>false</IsPackable>\r\n  </PropertyGroup>\r\n\r\n  <ItemGroup>\r\n    <PackageReference Include=\"Microsoft.NET.Test.Sdk\" Version=\"15.5.0-preview-20171009-10\" />\r\n    <PackageReference Include=\"xunit\" Version=\"2.3.0\" />\r\n    <PackageReference Include=\"xunit.runner.visualstudio\" Version=\"2.3.0\" />\r\n  </ItemGroup>\r\n\r\n</Project>\r\n```\r\n## Expected result\r\n![expected_output](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4337332/31483792-87f4f40a-af4b-11e7-99a3-ea10c76d638e.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Actual result\r\n![actual_output](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/4337332/31483800-8d6083fa-af4b-11e7-9a41-86d9ec5b48ac.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Root Cause\r\nCurrently code coverage need Full pdb for .NETCore, Settings portable type [here](https://github.com/xunit/xunit/blob/6ef433fe9a45469a3763efd6e8188bb627c4ef10/src/xunit.core/build/xunit.core.targets#L7) always caused the issue.\r\n\r\n## Workaround \r\nDowngrade xunit version to 2.3.0-beta5-build3769. \r\n\r\n## Proposed fix\r\nSet DebugType only when it is not define?\r\n/cc: @bradwilson @onovotny \r\n","closed_by":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":